(3. SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & SIGNAL PIPELINE) Tj
0 -22 Td
/F1 9.5 Tf
(The ClutterNet architecture operates as a synchronized 5-stage inline radar processor:) Tj
0 -20 Td
/F2 10 Tf
(STAGE 01: Radar I/Q Stream Ingestion) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(High-speed sFPDP/PCIe ingestion of raw 1024 Range x 128 Pulse coherent matrices from radar receiver.) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F2 10 Tf
(STAGE 02: Pulse-Doppler 2D-FFT & Calibration) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(Windowed 2D-FFT transform mapping time-domain pulses into Range-Doppler matrices with phase retention.) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F2 10 Tf
(STAGE 03: ClutterNet Complex U-Net Filter) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(Multi-scale encoder-decoder network with temporal attention gates trained on littoral sea clutter.) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F2 10 Tf
(STAGE 04: Epistemic Uncertainty & Fail-Safe Gate) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(Calculates model confidence. If uncertainty exceeds threshold tau=0.42 (e.g. ECM jamming), system) Tj
0 -13 Td
(instantly and autonomously engages hardware bypass to legacy CA-CFAR baseline.) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F2 10 Tf
(STAGE 05: Adaptive Tactical CFAR & Target Extraction) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(Ultra-low noise floor CFAR generates clean target tracks sent to shipboard Combat Management System.) Tj
0 -30 Td
/F2 13 Tf
(4. MATHEMATICAL FORMULATION) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(Received signal: Z(r, d) = S_target(r, d) + C_clutter(r, d; K_distribution) + N_thermal(r, d)) Tj
0 -15 Td
(Loss function: L_total = L_recon + alpha * (1 - PhaseCoherence) + beta * Pfa_penalty) Tj
0 -15 Td
(The loss directly penalizes false alarm leakage, ensuring radar false track suppression.) Tj
